The first thing I always wish for is 2 blessed scrolls of charging, so I 
can recharge the wand and get more wishes. I recommend you do so unless 
you already a blessed scroll of charging on hand.

You can make your items rustproof/fireproof by reading an uncursed or 
blessed scroll of enchant armor while confused. This will also fix the 
items. If memory serves correctly, a cursed scroll will remove the proofing.

My favorite wish item is a blessed magic marker - they are incredibly 
versatile and allow you to write any number of scrolls, including 
charging, taming, enchant weapon and enchant armor. After that, speed 
boots, amulets of life saving, and a blessed ring of levitation (if you 
can't find one) all make good wishes.

